var t={title:`Licensing`,blocks:[{kind:`html`,html:`<h1>Licensing</h1>
<p>bootlace is free and open source under the
<a href="https://github.com/Angular-Bootstrap-Project/angular-bootstrap/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apache License 2.0</a>.
You can use it in commercial and closed-source apps. Keep the licence and <code>NOTICE</code> files when you
redistribute the packages.</p>
<h2 id="packages"><a href="#packages">Packages</a></h2>
<div class="docs-markdown-table"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Licence</th><th>Contents</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>@bootlace/core</code></td><td>Apache-2.0</td><td>The components and their styles</td></tr><tr><td><code>@bootlace/icons</code></td><td>Apache-2.0</td><td>Icons derived from IconPark, \xA9 ByteDance Inc. (Apache-2.0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The icon artwork comes from <a href="https://github.com/bytedance/IconPark" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IconPark</a>. The generator replaces
its colours and stroke attributes with CSS custom properties and leaves the shapes unchanged.</p>
<h2 id="third-party-projects"><a href="#third-party-projects">Third-party projects</a></h2>
<div class="docs-markdown-table"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>Licence</th><th>How it is used</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://getbootstrap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bootstrap</a></td><td>MIT</td><td>Peer dependency for all styling. Not bundled</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/taiga-family/taiga-ui" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Taiga UI</a></td><td>Apache-2.0</td><td>The docs design and component APIs are adapted from it</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/ng-bootstrap/ng-bootstrap" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ng-bootstrap</a></td><td>MIT</td><td>Component behaviour is adapted from it</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/NG-ZORRO/ng-zorro-antd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NG-ZORRO</a></td><td>MIT</td><td>Component behaviour is adapted from it</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/bytedance/IconPark" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IconPark</a></td><td>Apache-2.0</td><td>Source of the icon artwork</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Files that adapt code from these projects say so in a header comment.</p>
<h2 id="this-site"><a href="#this-site">This site</a></h2>
<p>The docs self-host the <a href="https://github.com/sharanda/manrope" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Manrope</a> font (weights 500 and 800),
Copyright 2019 The Manrope Project Authors, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The licence text is
at <a href="/licenses/manrope/LICENSE">/licenses/manrope/LICENSE</a>. The npm packages do not include the font.</p>
`}]};export{t as CONTENT};